{%- comment -%}
  Pre-sell listicle: the page Meta ad traffic for the Coconut Moisturizer lands
  on (templates/page.presell-cream.json). Strangers on phones, one job: carry the
  ad's promise (7-ingredient base vs a 34-ingredient drugstore label) through to
  a single $28 jar.

  COPY IS NOT AUTHORED HERE. Every string comes from section/block settings,
  which scripts/presell/build-cream-template.mjs renders from
  data/presell/coconut-cream/content.json, the file the copy gate
  (tests/theme/presell-cream-copy.test.js) checks. Keep literal copy in this file
  to the few words tests/theme/presell-cream-template.test.js also gates.

  ABOVE THE FOLD IS ONE STILL. The hero image is the only media that loads on
  arrival (fetchpriority high). Every <video> carries data-src, not src, and no
  <source> child, so nothing is fetched until the visitor's first scroll starts
  the IntersectionObserver at the bottom, which swaps it in near the viewport. Posters are the first frame.

  PRICE IS LIVE. Copy carries "$28" (settings.price_token); it is replaced with
  the default variant's live price at render, so a price change cannot leave the
  page quoting a stale number. The multi-jar copy carries "2" and "$56"
  (quantity_token, total_token) and the pack copy "$84" and "$21"
  (pack_price_token, pack_unit_token); the script swaps in the chosen count,
  live price x count, the live pack price and pack price / pack_count.

  BUY BOX CONTRACT (assets/presell-buy.js binds to it, do not rename):
    form[data-presell-buy]#presell-buy > select[name=id] (one option per
    available scent, the default variant selected), the quantity stepper
    [data-presell-qty][data-max] with button[data-presell-qty-dec] /
    button[data-presell-qty-inc] / output[data-presell-qty-value], the hidden
    input[name=quantity], button[type=submit][data-presell-submit],
    p[data-presell-error][hidden]; the 4-pack banner [data-presell-pack] with
    button[data-presell-pack-buy] and p[data-presell-pack-error][hidden]; and the
    sticky phone bar a[data-presell-sticky][href="#presell-buy"]. Options carry
    data-scent, data-price, data-price-cents and, when the scent has an
    available 4-pack, data-pack-id / data-pack-price / data-pack-unit /
    data-pack-cents, so the script can relabel the buttons and show or hide the
    banner on a scent change. Each data-presell-label element carries
    data-presell-template (the unreplaced copy), and the multi-jar ones also
    data-presell-template-multi; the form carries every token.

  4-PACK BANNER: "buy 3, get the 4th free" is only TRUE while the pack costs at
  most three single jars, so the banner renders hidden unless the default scent
  has an available pack variant priced at or under three singles, and the
  script applies the same test on every scent change. Pack variants are named
  "4x <Scent>"; the leading "<n>x " is stripped to match a single jar's scent.
  Pack prices are live from all_products, never hardcoded.

  No Recurpay widget: this is a page, not a product template, so the app embed's
  product-form injection has no product to attach to. presell.css hides its
  classes anyway as a belt-and-braces.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign p = all_products[section.settings.product_handle]
  assign price_token = section.settings.price_token | default: '@@no-price-token@@'
  assign scent_token = section.settings.default_scent | default: '@@no-scent-token@@'

  assign dv = false
  for v in p.variants
    assign vid = v.id | append: ''
    if vid == section.settings.default_variant_id and v.available
      assign dv = v
    endif
  endfor
  unless dv
    assign dv = p.selected_or_first_available_variant
  endunless
  assign live_price = dv.price | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign live_scent = dv.option1 | default: scent_token

  assign pk = all_products[section.settings.pack_handle]
  assign pack_count = section.settings.pack_count | default: 4
  assign quantity_token = section.settings.quantity_token | default: '@@no-quantity-token@@'
  assign total_token = section.settings.total_token | default: '@@no-total-token@@'
  assign pack_price_token = section.settings.pack_price_token | default: '@@no-pack-price-token@@'
  assign pack_unit_token = section.settings.pack_unit_token | default: '@@no-pack-unit-token@@'

  assign rating = p.metafields.reviews.rating.value
  assign rating_count = p.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value | plus: 0
-%}

{{ 'presell.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<article class="presell" data-presell>

  <header class="presell-hero" data-presell-hero>
    <p class="presell-eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
    <h1 class="presell-headline">{{ section.settings.headline | escape }}</h1>
    {%- if rating and rating_count > 0 -%}
      {%- assign rating_value = rating.rating | round: 1 -%}
      {%- assign rating_pct = rating.rating | times: 100.0 | divided_by: rating.scale_max -%}
      <p class="presell-rating">
        <span class="presell-stars" aria-hidden="true"><span style="width: {{ rating_pct }}%"></span></span>
        <span>{{ rating_value }} out of 5 from {{ rating_count }} reviews</span>
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- assign hero_join = '?' -%}
    {%- if section.settings.hero_image contains '?' -%}{%- assign hero_join = '&' -%}{%- endif -%}
    <img
      class="presell-hero-img"
      src="{{ section.settings.hero_image }}{{ hero_join }}width=900"
      srcset="{{ section.settings.hero_image }}{{ hero_join }}width=600 600w, {{ section.settings.hero_image }}{{ hero_join }}width=900 900w, {{ section.settings.hero_image }}{{ hero_join }}width=1200 1200w"
      sizes="(min-width: 720px) 680px, 100vw"
      width="941" height="1000"
      alt="{{ section.settings.hero_alt | escape }}"
      fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async">
    <p class="presell-intro">{{ section.settings.intro | escape | replace: price_token, live_price }}</p>
  </header>

  {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
    {%- assign s = block.settings -%}
    {%- case block.type -%}

      {%- when 'reason' -%}
        <section class="presell-reason" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <h2 class="presell-reason-title">
            <span class="presell-num" aria-hidden="true">{{ s.number }}</span>
            <span>{{ s.title | escape }}</span>
          </h2>
          {%- if s.media_kind == 'video' -%}
            {%- assign poster_join = '?' -%}
            {%- if s.poster_url contains '?' -%}{%- assign poster_join = '&' -%}{%- endif -%}
            <figure class="presell-media presell-media--video">
              <video class="presell-video" muted loop playsinline autoplay preload="none" disablepictureinpicture
                poster="{{ s.poster_url }}{{ poster_join }}width=640" data-src="{{ s.media_url }}"
                width="720" height="1280" aria-label="{{ s.media_alt | escape }}"></video>
              {%- unless s.captions_burned_in -%}
                <figcaption class="presell-caption">{{ s.caption | escape }}</figcaption>
              {%- else -%}
                <figcaption class="presell-visually-hidden">{{ s.caption | escape }}</figcaption>
              {%- endunless -%}
            </figure>
          {%- else -%}
            {%- assign join = '?' -%}
            {%- if s.media_url contains '?' -%}{%- assign join = '&' -%}{%- endif -%}
            <figure class="presell-media presell-media--image">
              <img
                src="{{ s.media_url }}{{ join }}width=900"
                srcset="{{ s.media_url }}{{ join }}width=600 600w, {{ s.media_url }}{{ join }}width=900 900w"
                sizes="(min-width: 720px) 680px, 100vw"
                width="900" height="1125"
                alt="{{ s.media_alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            </figure>
          {%- endif -%}
          <p class="presell-body">{{ s.body | escape | replace: price_token, live_price }}</p>
        </section>

      {%- when 'label-compare' -%}
        {%- assign ours = s.ours_list | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
        {%- assign theirs = s.theirs_list | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
        <section class="presell-labels" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <h2 class="presell-labels-heading">{{ s.heading | escape }}</h2>
          <div class="presell-labels-grid">
            <div class="presell-label presell-label--ours">
              <h3>{{ s.ours_title | escape }}</h3>
              <ol>
                {%- for i in ours -%}{%- assign t = i | strip -%}{%- if t != blank -%}<li>{{ t | escape }}</li>{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
              </ol>
              <p class="presell-label-note">{{ s.ours_note | escape }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="presell-label presell-label--theirs">
              <h3>{{ s.theirs_title | escape }}</h3>
              <ol>
                {%- for i in theirs -%}{%- assign t = i | strip -%}{%- if t != blank -%}<li>{{ t | escape }}</li>{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
              </ol>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

      {%- when 'reviews' -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Five stars is a FACT about these three reviews, not decoration: each
          was checked 5/5 on Judge.me (759721043, 514327202, 605921156) on
          2026-10-19. Swap a review for one with fewer stars and this must change.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <section class="presell-reviews" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <h2>{{ s.heading | escape }}</h2>
          {%- for n in (1..3) -%}
            {%- assign qk = 'quote_' | append: n -%}
            {%- assign nk = 'name_' | append: n -%}
            {%- if s[qk] != blank -%}
              <figure class="presell-review">
                <p class="presell-review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</p>
                <blockquote><p>{{ s[qk] | escape }}</p></blockquote>
                <figcaption>{{ s[nk] | escape }} <span>Verified buyer</span></figcaption>
              </figure>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </section>

      {%- when 'cta' -%}
        <p class="presell-cta-wrap" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <a class="presell-button" href="#presell-buy" data-presell-label data-presell-template="{{ s.label | escape }}">{{ s.label | escape | replace: price_token, live_price | replace: scent_token, live_scent }}</a>
        </p>

      {%- when 'notes' -%}
        <aside class="presell-notes" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <h2>Good to know</h2>
          <ul>
            {%- if s.note_1 != blank -%}<li>{{ s.note_1 | escape }}</li>{%- endif -%}
            {%- if s.note_2 != blank -%}<li>{{ s.note_2 | escape }}</li>{%- endif -%}
          </ul>
        </aside>

      {%- when 'buy-box' -%}
        {%- liquid
          comment
            The default scent's 4-pack, for the server render of the banner.
            The per-scent packs are matched again inside the option loop below.
          endcomment
          assign dv_pack = false
          for pv in pk.variants
            unless pv.available
              continue
            endunless
            assign pscent = pv.option1 | default: pv.title
            assign first = pscent | split: ' ' | first
            assign last_char = first | slice: -1
            if last_char == 'x' or last_char == 'X'
              assign digits = first | remove_last: last_char
              assign n = digits | plus: 0
              assign back = n | append: ''
              if back == digits and n > 0
                assign pscent = pscent | remove_first: first | strip
              endif
            endif
            if pscent == dv.option1
              assign dv_pack = pv
              break
            endif
          endfor
          if dv_pack
            assign three_singles = dv.price | times: 3
            if dv_pack.price > three_singles
              assign dv_pack = false
            endif
          endif
          assign dv_pack_price = ''
          assign dv_pack_unit = ''
          if dv_pack
            assign dv_pack_price = dv_pack.price | money_without_trailing_zeros
            assign dv_unit_cents = dv_pack.price | times: 1.0 | divided_by: pack_count | round
            assign dv_pack_unit = dv_unit_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros
          endif
          assign bjoin = '?'
          if s.image_url contains '?'
            assign bjoin = '&'
          endif
        -%}
        <section class="presell-buy" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <div class="presell-pack" data-presell-pack{% unless dv_pack %} hidden{% endunless %}>
            <p class="presell-pack-headline">{{ s.pack_headline | escape }}</p>
            <p class="presell-pack-line" data-presell-label data-presell-template="{{ s.pack_line | escape }}">{{ s.pack_line | escape | replace: pack_price_token, dv_pack_price | replace: pack_unit_token, dv_pack_unit }}</p>
            <button type="button" class="presell-button presell-button--full presell-button--pack" data-presell-pack-buy data-presell-label data-presell-template="{{ s.pack_cta | escape }}">{{ s.pack_cta | escape | replace: pack_price_token, dv_pack_price | replace: pack_unit_token, dv_pack_unit }}</button>
            <p class="presell-error" data-presell-pack-error hidden role="alert"></p>
          </div>
          {%- if s.image_url != blank -%}
            <img class="presell-buy-img" src="{{ s.image_url }}{{ bjoin }}width=700"
              srcset="{{ s.image_url }}{{ bjoin }}width=350 350w, {{ s.image_url }}{{ bjoin }}width=700 700w"
              sizes="260px"
              width="{{ s.image_width }}" height="{{ s.image_height }}"
              alt="{{ s.image_alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          {%- endif -%}
          <h2 class="presell-buy-title" data-presell-label data-presell-template="{{ s.title | escape }}">{{ s.title | escape | replace: scent_token, live_scent }}</h2>
          <p class="presell-buy-price" data-presell-label data-presell-template="{{ s.price_note | escape }}" data-presell-template-multi="{{ s.price_note_multi | escape }}">{{ s.price_note | escape | replace: price_token, live_price }}</p>
          <form data-presell-buy data-price-token="{{ price_token | escape }}" data-scent-token="{{ scent_token | escape }}" data-quantity-token="{{ quantity_token | escape }}" data-total-token="{{ total_token | escape }}" data-pack-price-token="{{ pack_price_token | escape }}" data-pack-unit-token="{{ pack_unit_token | escape }}" id="presell-buy" class="presell-form" action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" method="post">
            <label class="presell-select-label" for="presell-scent">{{ s.scent_label | escape }}</label>
            <select id="presell-scent" name="id" class="presell-select">
              {%- for v in p.variants -%}
                {%- if v.available -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign vpack = false
                    for pv in pk.variants
                      unless pv.available
                        continue
                      endunless
                      assign pscent = pv.option1 | default: pv.title
                      assign first = pscent | split: ' ' | first
                      assign last_char = first | slice: -1
                      if last_char == 'x' or last_char == 'X'
                        assign digits = first | remove_last: last_char
                        assign n = digits | plus: 0
                        assign back = n | append: ''
                        if back == digits and n > 0
                          assign pscent = pscent | remove_first: first | strip
                        endif
                      endif
                      if pscent == v.option1
                        assign vpack = pv
                        break
                      endif
                    endfor
                  -%}
                  <option value="{{ v.id }}" data-scent="{{ v.option1 | escape }}" data-price="{{ v.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }}" data-price-cents="{{ v.price }}"
                    {%- if vpack -%}
                      {%- assign unit_cents = vpack.price | times: 1.0 | divided_by: pack_count | round %} data-pack-id="{{ vpack.id }}" data-pack-price="{{ vpack.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }}" data-pack-unit="{{ unit_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros }}" data-pack-cents="{{ vpack.price }}"
                    {%- endif -%}
                    {% if v.id == dv.id %} selected{% endif %}>{{ v.option1 | escape }}</option>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </select>
            <span class="presell-select-label" id="presell-qty-label">{{ s.quantity_label | escape }}</span>
            <div class="presell-qty" data-presell-qty data-max="{{ s.quantity_max }}" role="group" aria-labelledby="presell-qty-label">
              <button type="button" class="presell-qty-btn" data-presell-qty-dec aria-label="{{ s.quantity_less | escape }}" disabled>&minus;</button>
              <output class="presell-qty-value" data-presell-qty-value aria-live="polite">1</output>
              <button type="button" class="presell-qty-btn" data-presell-qty-inc aria-label="{{ s.quantity_more | escape }}">+</button>
            </div>
            <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
            <button type="submit" class="presell-button presell-button--full" data-presell-submit data-presell-label data-presell-template="{{ s.cta | escape }}" data-presell-template-multi="{{ s.cta_multi | escape }}">{{ s.cta | escape | replace: price_token, live_price | replace: scent_token, live_scent }}</button>
            <p class="presell-error" data-presell-error hidden role="alert"></p>
          </form>
          <p class="presell-buy-meta">{{ s.shipping | escape }}</p>
          <p class="presell-guarantee">{{ s.guarantee | escape }}</p>
        </section>
        <a class="presell-sticky presell-button" data-presell-sticky href="#presell-buy" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-presell-label data-presell-template="{{ s.cta | escape }}">{{ s.cta | escape | replace: price_token, live_price | replace: scent_token, live_scent }}</a>

    {%- endcase -%}
  {%- endfor -%}

</article>

<script>
  (function () {
    var root = document.querySelector('[data-presell]');
    if (!root) return;

    // Lazy video: nothing is observed until the visitor's FIRST SCROLL. Reason
    // 1's video sits ~840-940px down a 390px phone, inside a 650-750px in-app
    // viewport plus any look-ahead, so an observer created on parse fires for it
    // at once and the MP4 downloads during the hero's LCP window. Not `load`
    // either: a visitor who never scrolls never needs a video. After the first
    // scroll: swap data-src into src within 150px of the viewport bottom, play
    // while visible, pause when scrolled away. Pinned by
    // tests/theme/presell-cream-template.test.js (no observer on parse;
    // rootMargin at most 150px).
    var videos = root.querySelectorAll('video[data-src]');
    function load(v) {
      if (!v.getAttribute('src')) { v.src = v.getAttribute('data-src'); v.load(); }
      var p = v.play();
      if (p && p.catch) p.catch(function () {});
    }
    var started = false;
    function startVideos() {
      if (started) return;
      started = true;
      if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
        var vio = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
          entries.forEach(function (e) {
            if (e.isIntersecting) load(e.target);
            else if (e.target.getAttribute('src')) e.target.pause();
          });
        }, { rootMargin: '0px 0px 150px 0px' });
        videos.forEach(function (v) { vio.observe(v); });
      } else {
        videos.forEach(load);
      }
    }
    if (videos.length) window.addEventListener('scroll', startVideos, { passive: true, once: true });

    // Sticky phone CTA: shown once the hero has scrolled out, hidden again
    // while the buy box itself is on screen.
    var sticky = root.querySelector('[data-presell-sticky]');
    var hero = root.querySelector('[data-presell-hero]');
    var buy = document.getElementById('presell-buy');
    if (!sticky || !hero || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) return;
    var heroGone = false, buyShown = false;
    function sync() {
      var on = heroGone && !buyShown;
      sticky.classList.toggle('is-visible', on);
      sticky.setAttribute('aria-hidden', on ? 'false' : 'true');
      sticky.tabIndex = on ? 0 : -1;
    }
    new IntersectionObserver(function (e) { heroGone = !e[0].isIntersecting; sync(); }).observe(hero);
    if (buy) new IntersectionObserver(function (e) { buyShown = e[0].isIntersecting; sync(); }).observe(buy);
  })();
</script>
<script src="{{ 'presell-buy.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Pre-sell listicle",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "presell-section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Copy lives in data/presell content.json" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "headline", "label": "Headline" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "intro", "label": "Intro" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "hero_image", "label": "Hero image URL (a still, never a video)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "hero_alt", "label": "Hero image alt text" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "product_handle", "label": "Product handle", "default": "coconut-moisturizer" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "default_variant_id", "label": "Preselected variant id", "default": "44179428475050" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "default_scent", "label": "Preselected scent name, as written in the copy", "default": "Coconut Breeze" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "price_token", "label": "Price as written in the copy (replaced by the live price)", "default": "$28" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "pack_handle", "label": "4-pack product handle", "default": "coconut-moisturizer-4-pack" },
    { "type": "number", "id": "pack_count", "label": "Jars in the pack", "default": 4 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "quantity_token", "label": "Jar count as written in the multi-jar copy", "default": "2" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "total_token", "label": "Total as written in the multi-jar copy", "default": "$56" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "pack_price_token", "label": "Pack price as written in the copy", "default": "$84" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "pack_unit_token", "label": "Per-jar pack price as written in the copy", "default": "$21" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "reason",
      "name": "Reason",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "number", "id": "number", "label": "Number" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Title" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "body", "label": "Body" },
        {
          "type": "select", "id": "media_kind", "label": "Media kind", "default": "image",
          "options": [ { "value": "image", "label": "Image" }, { "value": "video", "label": "Video" } ]
        },
        { "type": "text", "id": "media_url", "label": "Image or video URL" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "media_alt", "label": "Alt text" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "poster_url", "label": "Video poster URL" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "caption", "label": "Video caption line" },
        { "type": "checkbox", "id": "captions_burned_in", "label": "Captions are burned into the video", "default": false }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "label-compare",
      "name": "Label comparison",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "ours_title", "label": "Our label title" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "ours_list", "label": "Our ingredients, one per line" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "ours_note", "label": "Note under our label" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "theirs_title", "label": "Their label title (never the brand name)" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "theirs_list", "label": "Their ingredients, one per line" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "reviews",
      "name": "Reviews",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "quote_1", "label": "Review 1 (word for word)" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "name_1", "label": "Review 1 name" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "quote_2", "label": "Review 2 (word for word)" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "name_2", "label": "Review 2 name" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "quote_3", "label": "Review 3 (word for word)" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "name_3", "label": "Review 3 name" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "cta",
      "name": "Call to action",
      "settings": [ { "type": "text", "id": "label", "label": "Button label" } ]
    },
